# ULX essentials

## Boundaries
- Implement only in **ulx-components** (`src/components`, demos, approved styles). **Do not edit** reference trees (`uls_v2`, `primereact-master`) or autogenerated `ulx/src/demo/ulx-ember/app/documentation/`.
- Demos live under `ulx/src/demo/ulx-ember/app/components/Demo/`; update demo source and snippets, not generated docs.

## Components (Ember 6.8)
- Glimmer `.gjs` under `src/components/`; PrimeReact = **reference only** (behavior/API/a11y), no React imports or PrimeReact comments.
- `getComponentClass()` from `src/utils/component-config.js` — never hardcode the `ulx-` prefix.
- `@action` for handlers; destructure `this.args` in getters; lowercase named blocks; if any named block exists, body goes in `<:default>`.
- i18n `t` for component strings; compose with existing Ulx* components; JSDoc `@param` on public args.
- Argument-driven, stateless; no lifecycle hooks, constructors, observers, or mixins — use modifiers/resources for effects.
- a11y: semantic HTML, `...attributes`, decorative UlxIcon `aria-hidden="true"`; meaningful icons via caller `aria-label`.
- `data-qa`: root `ulx-{component}`; parts `ulx-{component}-{part}`; optional `@dataQa` override.

## Styling & demos
- **CSS classes**: use only classes from **uls_v2** (`uls-styles/less/`); do not copy class names from PrimeReact, other frameworks, or ad-hoc sources.
- Prefer ULX components + existing `utill.less` utilities; no new utility names in templates.
- Overrides only in approved theme paths (`styles/editor`, `styles/gulx`, `styles/foundation`); no inline styles or ad-hoc component CSS.
- Demos/docs copy: **plain English literals** — no new keys in `src/locales/en-us.js`; use **variant** not severity in demos.

## Depth on demand
For full patterns, use skills: `ulx-component-authoring`, `ulx-consumer-ui`, `ulx-demo-doc-workflow`, `ulx-form-patterns`, `ulx-ui-patterns`, `ulx-data-display-patterns`.
